            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> [@echasnovski](https://github.com/echasnovski), would you accept a pull request, or do you have an idealogical issue with the request?\n\nI am not sure what you mean by \"ideological\", but this was closed as not planned for a reason, as adding this functionality is not planned (i.e. out of scope). There are several workarounds for this, depending on the culprit of why this is important: call use `:G` command from 'vim-fugitive', `require('mini.git').setup()` before 'vim-fugitive' creates its own command, not call `setup()`, etc.",
